flowchart TD
    A[Job discovered or open in browser] --> B{Job already in system?}
    B -->|No| C[Capture / ingest job]
    B -->|Yes| D[Open canonical job]
    C --> D

    D --> E[Choose search profile]
    E --> F[Choose CV version]
    F --> G[Extract / load job requirements]
    G --> H[Compare CV evidence]

    H --> I[Evidenced]
    H --> J[Partially evidenced]
    H --> K[Not evidenced]
    H --> L[Needs confirmation]

    I --> M{Next action}
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M

    M -->|CV is ready| N[Use selected CV]
    M -->|Prepare later| O[Save job + preferred CV version]
    M -->|Improve now| P[Create tailoring session]

    P --> Q[Review suggestions]
    Q --> R{Suggestion adds a new fact?}
    R -->|No| S[Accept / edit / ignore rewrite]
    R -->|Yes| T[Ask user to confirm and provide factual evidence]
    T --> U{Confirmed?}
    U -->|No| V[Do not add fact]
    U -->|Yes| S

    S --> W[Edit working draft]
    V --> W
    W --> X[Preview]
    X --> Y[Save as new immutable CV version]
    Y --> Z[Download PDF / DOCX]
    Y --> AA[Apply]
    N --> AA
    O --> AB[Resume later with same CV version]
    AB --> P

    AA --> AC[Application stores exact CvVersion]
    AC --> AD[Application timeline / follow-up]
